NOTICE

This repository contains only build scripts, a small patch, web page code and an original icon.
It contains no game code, assets, textures, audio, or ROM data.

- build.py downloads sm64-port (https://github.com/sm64-port/sm64-port), which is based on the
  Super Mario 64 decompilation (https://github.com/n64decomp/sm64), and builds it with assets
  extracted from a ROM that you must supply yourself.
- Everything the build produces (work/, dist/, the .wgt package) embeds Nintendo's assets.
  It is for your own use: do not upload or redistribute it, or the ROM.
- "Super Mario 64" and related marks are trademarks of Nintendo. This project is unofficial,
  unaffiliated with and not endorsed by Nintendo or Samsung.
- Emscripten, w64devkit, sdb / Tizen Studio and the Tizen test certificates are third-party
  tools used under their own terms; build.py downloads the toolchain, nothing of it is
  redistributed here.
